<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">sneak</ansi>

Attempt to slip into the shadows and become hidden.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">sneak</ansi>

In an empty room, you hide automatically. If others are
present, you must beat each observer's Perception in an
opposed roll. If anyone spots you, the attempt fails.

Party members won't give you away.

Requires the <ansi fg="skill">skullduggery</ansi> skill.

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help skullduggery</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help steal</ansi>
